</div>                     <milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/>                     <lb/>
<div type="jPoliticalNews">                         <head><hi rendition="#c #g">Jtalien.</hi></head>                         <lb/>
<div type="jArticle">                             <p>Dem Mailänder officiellen Blatt zufolge hat der Kö-<lb/>
