<p>Die &#x017F;chönen kupferbodenen Dampf&#x017F;chiffe<lb/>
<hi rendition="#c"><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#b">Gauthiod,</hi></hi> Capt. P. G. <hi rendition="#g">Nyl<hi rendition="#aq">é</hi>n,</hi><lb/>
